# Build Specification: Private Daily Class Memory App

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a production-ready mobile-first social memory application for schools, colleges, friend groups, clubs, and private communities.

The core concept:

> Every member takes or uploads exactly one photo every day. All authorized members of the group can see everyone's daily photo. Over time, the app builds a private, chronological collection of shared memories that can eventually become a digital yearbook.

The product should feel:

* Fun
* Modern
* Youthful
* Private
* Simple
* Photo-first
* Nostalgic
* Social without becoming another public social network

The application must be designed so that the frontend can be completely redesigned later without requiring major backend changes.

