# 7. PHOTO UPLOAD WORKFLOW

## User workflow

```text
Open app
    ↓
Today's photo status
    ↓
Take Photo / Choose Photo
    ↓
Preview
    ↓
Optional crop
    ↓
Optional caption
    ↓
Upload
    ↓
Image processing
    ↓
Private storage
    ↓
Create database post
    ↓
Post appears in today's class feed
```

## Image processing

Before storage:

* Resize large images
* Generate optimized display version
* Generate thumbnail
* Strip EXIF metadata
* Remove GPS metadata
* Validate MIME type
* Validate file size
* Reject unsupported formats
* Prevent malicious file uploads

Support common formats such as:

```text
JPEG
PNG
WEBP
HEIC if platform supports conversion
```

Do not expose original metadata to other users.

