# 51. FRONTEND CUSTOMIZATION PRINCIPLE

The frontend must be treated as a replaceable presentation layer.

Use:

```text
UI
 ↓
Hooks / View Models
 ↓
API Services
 ↓
Backend
```

Do not do:

```text
Screen
 ↓
Direct database access
```

Do not mix:

* API calls
* database logic
* authentication logic
* image storage logic
* business rules

inside visual components.

Example:

Bad:

```text
PhotoCard
    ↓
Database query
    ↓
Storage request
    ↓
Permission calculation
```

Good:

```text
PhotoCard
    ↓
receives Post data
    ↓
renders UI
```

Business logic lives elsewhere.

